{"seq":11,"slug":"geometry-trigonometry","title":"几何与三角学","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":2.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"几何与三角学-简介\">几何与三角学 简介</h1><p>本 hub 处理 13 号「数学与统计」分区里<strong>与空间形状、角度、坐标直接相关的可计算几何</strong>：欧氏几何的公理与定理、三角函数与恒等式、把代数引入几何的解析几何，以及面向工程落地的计算几何算法。它的核心立场是<strong>几何作为程序员的日常工具</strong>——碰撞检测、坐标变换、寻路、光照、逆运动学背后那一层「形状与角度的数学」，都在这里讲清楚原理并给出可实现的算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>几何相关的内容散落在 13 号分区的多个 hub，最常被混淆的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的问题</th>\n<th>应去的 hub</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三角形怎么算、向量点积叉积、凸包/线段相交怎么写</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub</strong></td>\n<td>初等几何 + 三角 + 解析几何 + 计算几何算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵、特征值、SVD、线性变换的一般理论</td>\n<td><a href=\"../linear-algebra/\">线性代数</a></td>\n<td>几何变换的代数引擎，比「向量与几何」一节更系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极限、导数、积分、梯度、弧长积分</td>\n<td><a href=\"../calculus-applications/\">微积分及其应用</a></td>\n<td>连续变化与累积；本 hub 只在需要时引用其结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曲率、测地线、流形、黎曼度量</td>\n<td><a href=\"../differential-geometry/\">微分几何</a></td>\n<td>用微积分研究「弯曲」，是本 hub 的进阶延伸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续变换下的不变量、同胚、亏格</td>\n<td><a href=\"../topology-intro/\">拓扑学入门</a></td>\n<td>抛开距离与角度的「橡皮几何」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中学代数、函数、方程不等式的运算基本功</td>\n<td><a href=\"../basic-algebra-functions/\">基础代数与函数</a></td>\n<td>全分区的入门基石，本 hub 默认你已掌握</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点误差、数值求根、数值积分的算法细节</td>\n<td><a href=\"../numerical-methods/\">数值方法</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 的计算几何章只点到 epsilon 与鲁棒性，深入在此</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 管「形状/角度的具体几何与算法」，把「一般线性理论」交给线性代数，把「连续/弯曲」交给微积分与微分几何，把「数值工程细节」交给数值方法。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><p>四章按「严谨基础 → 周期工具 → 代数化 → 工程落地」递进，但不同目标的读者侧重不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>图形/游戏程序员（最常见）</strong>：第 2 章三角函数 → 第 3 章解析几何（重点向量与坐标系）→ 第 4 章计算几何。第 1 章欧氏几何可按需查阅。这条路径直通碰撞检测、坐标变换、光照与寻路。</li>\n<li><strong>算法竞赛选手</strong>：直接第 3 章「向量与几何」→ 第 4 章全章（凸包、线段相交、Voronoi/Delaunay、几何编程的鲁棒性）。三角函数与解析几何作为工具按需补。</li>\n<li><strong>机器人/SLAM 方向</strong>：第 2 章（尤其三角方程与逆运动学）→ 第 3 章坐标系统 → 配合 <a href=\"../../robotics-automation/robotics-fundamentals/kinematics-basics/inverse-kinematics\">逆运动学</a> 与 <a href=\"../../robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/ros2-fundamentals/tf2-transforms\">ROS2 坐标变换</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>数学基础补强者</strong>：从第 1 章欧氏几何（公理化与证明方法）顺序读完，建立严格推理习惯，再进入后三章。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每章末的 INDEX 给出该章内部顺序；每篇 L4 文末的「延伸阅读与跨学科链接」标出了到兄弟篇与其它 hub 的真实跳转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：<a href=\"../basic-algebra-functions/\">基础代数与函数</a>级别的代数运算、函数与方程；任一门编程语言的基本能力（示例多用伪代码/JS 风格）。</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章建议</strong>：<a href=\"../linear-algebra/\">线性代数</a>的向量与矩阵基础，会让「向量与几何」「坐标系统」理解得更深。</li>\n<li><strong>第 4 章建议</strong>：对时间复杂度有基本概念；遇到浮点鲁棒性问题时可回查 <a href=\"../numerical-methods/\">数值方法</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶出口</strong>：学完本 hub，想继续深入「弯曲空间」走 <a href=\"../differential-geometry/\">微分几何</a>，想要「连续变换的不变量」走 <a href=\"../topology-intro/\">拓扑学入门</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"euclidean-geometry","title":"欧几里得几何","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/euclidean-geometry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"axioms-postulates","title":"公理与公设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/euclidean-geometry/axioms-postulates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"triangles-polygons","title":"三角形与多边形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/euclidean-geometry/triangles-polygons"},{"seq":3,"slug":"circles-conics","title":"圆与圆锥曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/euclidean-geometry/circles-conics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"geometric-proofs","title":"几何证明方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/euclidean-geometry/geometric-proofs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"trigonometric-functions","title":"三角函数与恒等式","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/trigonometric-functions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trig-basics","title":"三角函数基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/trigonometric-functions/trig-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trig-identities","title":"三角恒等式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/trigonometric-functions/trig-identities"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inverse-trig","title":"反三角函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/trigonometric-functions/inverse-trig"},{"seq":4,"slug":"trig-equations","title":"三角方程求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/trigonometric-functions/trig-equations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"analytic-geometry","title":"解析几何","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/analytic-geometry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"coordinate-systems","title":"坐标系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/analytic-geometry/coordinate-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conic-sections","title":"圆锥曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/analytic-geometry/conic-sections"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parametric-polar","title":"参数方程与极坐标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/analytic-geometry/parametric-polar"},{"seq":4,"slug":"vectors-geometry","title":"向量与几何","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/analytic-geometry/vectors-geometry"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"computational-geometry","title":"计算几何基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/computational-geometry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"convex-hull","title":"凸包算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/computational-geometry/convex-hull"},{"seq":2,"slug":"line-intersection","title":"线段相交判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/computational-geometry/line-intersection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"voronoi-delaunay","title":"Voronoi 图与 Delaunay 三角剖分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/computational-geometry/voronoi-delaunay"},{"seq":4,"slug":"geometry-programming","title":"几何编程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/geometry-trigonometry/computational-geometry/geometry-programming"}]}]}